<title>USA: Federated Investors to acquire Penn fund assets.</title>
<headline>Federated Investors to acquire Penn fund assets.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federated Investors said on Monday that it has reached a definitive agreement with William Penn Co to assume the investment management and distribution responsibilities for seven of Penn's retail mutual funds with about $600 million in assets.</p>
<p>The funds are sold to shareholders located primarily in northeastern Pennsylvania, New York and New Jersey and will be merged into existing Federated funds.</p>
</text>
